    // - Small objects (<=16 chunks, <=2 MiB): use single stream, no intermediate syncs
    // - Medium objects (<=64 chunks, <=8 MiB): use 2 streams, no intermediate syncs
    // - Large objects (>64 chunks): use 2 streams, periodic syncs
